==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|усынови́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|усынови́ть|pf|impf=усыновля́ть}}

# to [[adopt]], to [[affiliate]] {{gloss|to take by choice into relationship as child}}

====Usage notes====
* The term is derived from {{l|ru|сын|gloss=son}}, so originally it meant to make someone one's son. It is also used as a generic term for adoption. To refer to female adoption specifically, use {{l|ru|удочери́ть}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4b+p|усынови́ть}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|усынови́тель|g=m-an}}, {{l|ru|усынови́тельница|g=f-an}}
* {{l|ru|усыновле́ние|g=n}}
